<title>GERMANY: MG made 342 mln marks 95/96 operating profit.</title>
<headline>MG made 342 mln marks 95/96 operating profit.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metallgesellschaft AG said on Monday it made an operating profit of 342 million marks ($220.8 million) in the 1995/96 year ended September 30 and plans to earn a profit of 359 million in the current 1996/97 year.</p>
<p>MG chief executive Kajo Neukirchen displayed the figures during a speech to the American Chamber of Commerce in Frankfurt.</p>
<p>MG last month announced that its pre-tax profits jumped 70 percent to over 290 million marks in 1995/96.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.549 German Marks)</p>
</text>
